        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn SC9BG, Smooth Black Iron Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Matte Black Single Cylinder Deadbolt is operated by a thumbturn from the interior and a key from the exterior. It has a black finish, making it a great choice for traditional as well as modern homes. The Smooth Black Iron Single Cylinder Deadbolt will fit door 1-3/8 inches thick up to 1-3/4 inches thick with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>5 pin tumbler.</li>\r\n<li>Nickel plated silver pins.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible and will fit standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Smooth Black Iron Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Smooth Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: fits 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Square strike: 1-1/8\" x 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Crossbore: 2-1/8\", Edgebore: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
